msgid ""
"Goal: get a `freeswitch` process running from **this clone** and prove it"
" with `fs_cli -x status`. Vanilla XML is a demo PBX, not a production "
"baseline (`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`). Operator-facing first-"
"call steps (register 1000/1001, dial `9196`) match [Users Manual Chapter "
"2](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-"
"started)."
msgstr ""
"目标：从 **本克隆** 跑起 `freeswitch` 进程，并用 `fs_cli -x status` 验证。Vanilla XML 是演示 "
"PBX，不是生产基线（`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。面向运维的首呼步骤（注册 1000/1001、拨 "
"`9196`）与 [用户手册第 2 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-"
"started) 一致。"

