"`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` include `build-essential`, `cmake`,"
" `automake`, `autoconf`, `libtool-bin`, `pkg-config`, `libssl-dev`, "
"`zlib1g-dev`, `libpcre2-dev`, `libedit-dev`, `libsqlite3-dev`, `libcurl4"
"-openssl-dev`, `libspeexdsp-dev`, `libopus-dev`, `libsndfile1-dev`, "
"`liblua5.2-dev`, `python3-dev`, `libpq-dev`, and related codec/AV "
"headers."
msgstr ""
"`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` 中用于 Debian/Ubuntu 源码构建的软件包包括 "
"`build-essential`、`cmake`、`automake`、`autoconf`、`libtool-bin`、`pkg-config"
"`、`libssl-dev`、`zlib1g-dev`、`libpcre2-dev`、`libedit-"
"dev`、`libsqlite3-dev`、`libcurl4-openssl-dev`、`libspeexdsp-dev`、`libopus-"
"dev`、`libsndfile1-dev`、`liblua5.2-dev`、`python3-dev`、`libpq-dev` "
"以及相关编解码器/AV 头文件。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:23
