msgid ""
"Install Sofia-SIP (and libks / SpanDSP / signalwire-c) first, the same "
"way CI and `docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` do. Library layout and "
"NUA usage: [Sofia-SIP](../1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md#sofia-sip-"
"library). Then, from the repo root:"
msgstr ""
"先按 CI 和 `docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` 的方式安装 Sofia-SIP（以及 libks / "
"SpanDSP / signalwire-c）。然后在仓库根目录执行："

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:47
#: 406dcec9e0d3452fa9eb5636eb4adb22
msgid ""
"`bootstrap.sh` copies `build/modules.conf.in` → `modules.conf` if "
"missing, then runs Autotools. `-j` parallelizes library bootstraps."
msgstr ""
"若缺少 `modules.conf`，`bootstrap.sh` 会把 `build/modules.conf.in` 复制为 "
"`modules.conf`，然后运行 Autotools。`-j` 用于并行引导依赖库。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:48
#: 7f07c6cc4fb44f75866cba2612784c52
msgid ""
"Default prefix without `--prefix` is `/usr/local/freeswitch` "
"(`configure.ac`). The explicit `--disable-fhs` keeps this developer "
"install under `$HOME/fs`; a custom prefix without that flag uses FHS "
"paths such as `$HOME/fs/etc/freeswitch` and "
"`$HOME/fs/var/log/freeswitch`."
msgstr ""
"不带 `--prefix` 时默认前缀为 `/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。显式指定 "
"`--disable-fhs` 会使本开发者安装位于 `$HOME/fs` 下；未指定该选项的自定义前缀会使用 FHS 路径，例如 "
"`$HOME/fs/etc/freeswitch` 和 `$HOME/fs/var/log/freeswitch`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:49
#: add80a16796b4dada8c67643ded176d7
msgid ""
"`make install` also installs vanilla sample config when `$(confdir)` does"
" not exist (`Makefile.am`: `test -d $(DESTDIR)$(confdir) || $(MAKE) "
"samples-conf`)."
msgstr ""
"当 `$(confdir)` 不存在时，`make install` 还会安装 vanilla 示例配置（`Makefile.am`：`test "
"-d $(DESTDIR)$(confdir) || $(MAKE) samples-conf`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:50
#: 03aa50cac91b43cdb0dea7005eb42e33
msgid ""
"Prompts and music-on-hold are **not** in this git tree. After `make "
"install`, [Chapter "
"2](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-"
"started) also runs `make cd-sounds-install cd-moh-install` (Callie 8 kHz "
"packages; `Makefile.am` `sounds-install`). Skip only if you do not need "
"playback/echo tests."
msgstr ""
"提示音与保持音乐**不在**本 git 树中。`make install` 之后，[第 2 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-"
"started) 还会跑 `make cd-sounds-install cd-moh-install`（Callie 8 kHz "
"包；`Makefile.am` 的 `sounds-install`）。只有不需要放音/回声测试时才可跳过。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:51
#: 18464b79c61f44c5863ac71255b2f91f
msgid ""
"Debug symbols without changing configure flags: `./devel-bootstrap.sh` "
"sets `CFLAGS`/`CXXFLAGS` to `-ggdb3 -O0` then bootstraps and configures."
msgstr ""
"无需改 configure 参数即可带调试符号：`./devel-bootstrap.sh` 将 `CFLAGS`/`CXXFLAGS` 设为 "
"`-ggdb3 -O0`，然后执行 bootstrap 和 configure。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:53
#: e2bbcdd5d09546edaf1377415102e862
msgid ""
"Enable extra modules by uncommenting lines in `modules.conf` **after** "
"bootstrap and **before** `./configure` / `make`. CI’s unit-test configure"
" (`ci.sh`) is an example of that edit pattern."
msgstr ""
"在 bootstrap **之后**、`./configure` / `make` **之前**，通过取消 `modules.conf` "
"中对应行的注释来启用额外模块。CI 的单元测试 configure（`ci.sh`）就是这种修改方式的例子。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:55
#: 220adb4aa59d4072b55bc8ecc203a010
msgid "Install from packages (Debian)"
msgstr "从软件包安装（Debian）"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:57
#: 5d4cbe57695747e59bf1bc9e3a17a3cf
msgid ""
"Requires a SignalWire Personal Access Token. From "
"`scripts/packaging/README.md`:"
msgstr "需要 SignalWire Personal Access Token。摘自 `scripts/packaging/README.md`："

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:65
#: 932a4c69ac664589bffa4d97a15ff476
msgid ""
"`release` tracks packaged releases; `prerelease` tracks what you see on "
"`master`."
msgstr "`release` 跟踪已打包发行版；`prerelease` 跟踪你在 `master` 上看到的内容。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:67
#: a7377555e9294f93b53d4d6dfa553d7b
msgid ""
"Meta packages (Users Manual Ch 2): `freeswitch-meta-all` (every module), "
"`freeswitch-meta-vanilla` (vanilla set + typically `freeswitch-sounds-en-"
"us-callie` / `freeswitch-sounds-music`), `freeswitch-meta-default`, "
"`freeswitch-meta-bare`. Packaged config root is `/etc/freeswitch`; "
"systemd: `systemctl enable --now freeswitch`."
msgstr ""
"元软件包（用户手册第 2 章）：`freeswitch-meta-all`（全部模块）、`freeswitch-meta-"
"vanilla`（vanilla 集合，通常还带 `freeswitch-sounds-en-us-callie` / `freeswitch-"
"sounds-music`）、`freeswitch-meta-default`、`freeswitch-meta-bare`。打包安装的配置根是"
" `/etc/freeswitch`；systemd：`systemctl enable --now freeswitch`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:69
