#: 46499ef363724113b73f4fc895306edf
msgid ""
"Runtime containers expect **host networking** (`docker/README.md`). "
"Typical ports: SIP 5060/5080, TLS 5061/5081, Sofia SIP WebSocket "
"5066/7443, Verto WS/WSS 8081/8082, ESL **8021**, RTP UDP ranges "
"16384–32768 and 64535–65535."
msgstr ""
"运行时容器需要 **host 网络**（`docker/README.md`）。常见端口：SIP 5060/5080、TLS "
"5061/5081、Sofia SIP WebSocket 5066/7443、Verto WS/WSS 8081/8082、ESL "
"**8021**、RTP UDP 范围 16384–32768 和 64535–65535。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:83
#: 1b3321219e12423a9e4528ff1357c598
