#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:96
#: 008043954d324435b734c752d6238ee2
msgid ""
"Host networking is a Linux feature and avoids publishing the large RTP "
"ranges individually. Do not add `-p` options when using `--network host`."
msgstr "Host 网络是 Linux 特性，可避免逐一发布较大的 RTP 端口范围。使用 `--network host` 时不要添加 `-p` 选项。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/02-quick-start.md:98
#: f21e76b957604df6996047572101f3d8
