"`loopback.auto`, so `fs_cli -H <lan-ip>` is rejected until you set an "
"explicit list — [Remote Event Socket ACL](../5.operations/01-runbook.md"
"#remote-event-socket-acl). Change the password, bind, and ACL before "
"exposing the vanilla configuration outside a trusted management network."
msgstr ""
"`fs_cli` 客户端默认连接 `127.0.0.1:8021`，密码为 "
"`ClueCon`（`libs/esl/fs_cli.conf`）。Vanilla 运行时配置监听通配 IPv6 `::`:8021，入站 ACL"
" 被注释掉（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`）；模块示例绑定 "
"`127.0.0.1`（`src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/conf/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`）。在将"
" vanilla 配置暴露到可信管理网络之外之前，请修改密码、绑定地址并启用 ACL。"

